<p><%= mail_greeting %></p>
<p>Sending has been paused on your EsignCenter account, so no new documents can be sent or started from it for now.</p>
<% if @reason == 'complaint' %>
  <p>Why: a recipient reported an email from this account as spam. One complaint is enough to pause sending, because repeated complaints would hurt delivery for everyone on the platform.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>Why: too many of the emails sent from this account recently could not be delivered (hard bounces). A high bounce rate would hurt delivery for everyone on the platform.</p>
<% end %>
<p>What still works: signers on documents you already sent can still open and complete them, and you can still download every document.</p>
<p>What happens next: we will review the account and reply. If you think this was a mistake, or want to explain what happened, write to <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
